{docstring Infomaterial.Relational.Spacetime.Boundary.Infohole.EventHorizon}

The canonical constructor builds that carrier from a causal set and readout:

{docstring Infomaterial.Relational.Spacetime.Boundary.Infohole.EventHorizon.ofReadout}

Its surface laws expose the horizon as a causal boundary:

{docstring Infomaterial.Relational.Spacetime.Boundary.Infohole.EventHorizon.surface_interior}

{docstring Infomaterial.Relational.Spacetime.Boundary.Infohole.EventHorizon.surface_not_exterior}

{docstring Infomaterial.Relational.Spacetime.Boundary.Infohole.EventHorizon.interior_no_future_to_exterior}

{docstring Infomaterial.Relational.Spacetime.Boundary.Infohole.EventHorizon.surface_has_exterior_predecessor}

